{"id":"z03-19","volume":3,"volumeTitle":"周纪三","volumeSubtitle":"前302","index":19,"title":{"t":"赧王十三年","s":"赧王十三年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀三 · 前302 · 己未","s":"周纪三 · 前302 · 己未"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦王、魏王和韩太子婴在临晋相会，韩太子到了咸阳之后才回国；秦国把蒲阪重新交给魏国。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"太","s":"太","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"嬰","s":"婴","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"會","s":"会","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"于","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"臨","s":"临","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"晉","s":"晋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"太","s":"太","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"至","s":"至","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"咸","s":"咸","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"陽","s":"阳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"而","s":"而","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歸","s":"归","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"復","s":"复","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"與","s":"与","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"魏","s":"魏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"蒲","s":"蒲","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"阪","s":"阪","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦国有个大夫私下和楚国太子打斗，太子把他杀了，逃回楚国。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"夫","s":"夫","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"有","s":"有","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"私","s":"私","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"與","s":"与","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"太","s":"太","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"鬬","s":"鬬","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"太","s":"太","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"殺","s":"杀","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"亡","s":"亡","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歸","s":"归","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"周赧王十三年是公元前302年。秦王、魏王和韩太子婴在临晋相会，韩太子还到咸阳才回国，秦把上年夺取的蒲阪交还魏国，用来拉拢韩、魏。同时，在秦做人质的楚太子和一个秦大夫私下打斗，把对方杀死，逃回楚国。黄棘以来的秦楚和好，就坏在这件私事上。","theme":"一面是秦与韩、魏在临晋修好，蒲阪还给魏；一面是楚太子杀秦大夫后逃亡。前一件让秦在东边暂时缓和，后一件使楚失去留在秦国的人质，也给了秦问罪的理由。这场私斗不是战场交锋，却把楚怀王推向后来的武关之会。","technique":"一年只记两事，没有「臣光曰」。前一句把会盟地点、韩太子进入咸阳和归还蒲阪写在一起，显出秦对韩、魏是怀柔。后一句换成一场私斗，「杀之，亡归」四个字把太子的罪和出走一次写完。外交礼数和一个人的斗殴都被编年并列，后患留到下一年。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"临晋","reading":"lín jìn","note":"地名。秦王、魏王和韩太子婴在这里会面。"},{"word":"鬬","reading":"dòu","note":"打斗。这个秦大夫私下和楚太子打了起来。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"复","reading":"fù","note":"再次。蒲阪上年被秦夺走，这一年又交还魏国。"},{"word":"与","reading":"yǔ","note":"「私与」的与是跟、同，表示和楚太子对打。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"亡","note":"「亡归」的亡是逃走，不是死了以后才回去。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"有私与楚太子鬬者","note":"用「有……者」指出那个私下打斗的秦大夫，不必先写他的姓名。"}]}}
